### NexusCore ###
# Build transcripts captured for milestone evidence blocks live outside the repo.
*.log
build-*.log
# Local dedicated servers used to verify each packaged JAR on the real loader.
# One per loader, named to match the project directories.
neoforgeserver/
fabricserver/
forgeserver/

# Server logs, in any loader's run directory.
*.log.gz
logs/

# Released artifacts ARE tracked on purpose: archived/ is the record of what shipped.
!archived/
!archived/**
